sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User Device
  participant API as Node.js API
  participant AUTH as Auth + HWID
  participant ACL as Permission Engine
  participant DB as MariaDB
  participant S2 as Other Devices

  U->>API: HTTPS login + device public key
  API->>AUTH: Verify password, MFA, device signature
  AUTH->>DB: Check user, device, status, expiry
  DB-->>AUTH: Approved / blocked
  AUTH-->>API: Short access token + refresh token
  API->>ACL: Check function + branch permission
  ACL->>DB: Read user roles and permissions
  DB-->>ACL: allow / deny
  ACL-->>API: Permission result
  U->>API: Create sale / stock change with idempotency key
  API->>DB: Transaction + row lock + audit log
  DB-->>API: Commit with server version
  API-->>U: Success + updated stock
  API-->>S2: WebSocket event: stock version changed
  S2->>API: Pull missing versions if offline
  API->>DB: Read versioned movements
  DB-->>API: Ordered events
  API-->>S2: Apply events / resolve conflict
  API->>DB: Save sync cursor and audit record
